{"id":"dudoan-04","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/dudoan-04/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":947.95,"segments":[{"start":0.05,"end":9.29,"text":"Section 4 You will hear part of a student presentation about a conservation project on the Florida coast of the United States.","words":[["Section",0.05,0.69],["4",0.69,1.21],["You",1.21,2.69],["will",2.69,2.87],["hear",2.87,3.13],["part",3.13,3.45],["of",3.45,3.63],["a",3.63,3.75],["student",3.75,4.03],["presentation",4.03,4.77],["about",4.77,5.25],["a",5.25,5.47],["conservation",5.47,5.93],["project",5.93,6.69],["on",6.69,7.09],["the",7.09,7.23],["Florida",7.23,7.57],["coast",7.57,7.95],["of",7.95,8.27],["the",8.27,8.41],["United",8.41,8.63],["States.",8.63,9.29]]},{"start":10.33,"end":15.67,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on page 7.","words":[["First",10.33,11.01],["you",11.01,11.21],["have",11.21,11.35],["some",11.35,11.53],["time",11.53,11.93],["to",11.93,12.19],["look",12.19,12.35],["at",12.35,12.51],["questions",12.51,12.81],["31",12.81,13.59],["to",13.59,13.87],["40",13.87,14.25],["on",14.25,14.85],["page",14.85,15.15],["7.",15.15,15.67]]},{"start":66.28,"end":69.94,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now",66.28,66.6],["listen",66.6,66.94],["carefully",66.94,67.42],["and",67.42,67.74],["answer",67.74,68.12],["questions",68.12,68.54],["31",68.54,69.36],["to",69.36,69.58],["40.",69.58,69.94]]},{"start":73.23,"end":79.65,"text":"Today I'm going to be talking about the first year of a regeneration project in a mangrove forest.","words":[["Today",73.23,73.73],["I'm",73.73,74.19],["going",74.19,74.37],["to",74.37,74.59],["be",74.59,74.69],["talking",74.69,75.01],["about",75.01,75.35],["the",75.35,75.63],["first",75.63,75.93],["year",75.93,76.45],["of",76.45,76.75],["a",76.75,76.89],["regeneration",76.89,77.33],["project",77.33,78.21],["in",78.21,78.57],["a",78.57,78.69],["mangrove",78.69,79.31],["forest.",79.31,79.65]]},{"start":79.65,"end":90.35,"text":"Mangrove forests are found along river estuaries and coastlines and are important because they prevent flooding by acting as a barrier between the land and sea.","words":[["Mangrove",79.65,81.01],["forests",81.01,81.55],["are",81.55,81.81],["found",81.81,82.15],["along",82.15,82.47],["river",82.47,82.87],["estuaries",82.87,83.61],["and",83.61,83.91],["coastlines",83.91,84.57],["and",84.57,85.23],["are",85.23,85.45],["important",85.45,85.91],["because",85.91,86.31],["they",86.31,86.57],["prevent",86.57,86.93],["flooding",86.93,87.31],["by",87.31,87.89],["acting",87.89,88.25],["as",88.25,88.45],["a",88.45,88.53],["barrier",88.53,88.83],["between",88.83,89.31],["the",89.31,89.53],["land",89.53,89.79],["and",89.79,90.03],["sea.",90.03,90.35]]},{"start":90.99,"end":97.35,"text":"The mangrove trees have special roots which can breathe and allow them to survive in thick, airless mud.","words":[["The",90.99,91.17],["mangrove",91.17,91.69],["trees",91.69,92.01],["have",92.01,92.29],["special",92.29,92.65],["roots",92.65,93.07],["which",93.07,93.51],["can",93.51,93.71],["breathe",93.71,94.17],["and",94.17,94.51],["allow",94.51,94.77],["them",94.77,95.03],["to",95.03,95.21],["survive",95.21,95.69],["in",95.69,96.01],["thick,",96.01,96.39],["airless",96.49,97.01],["mud.",97.01,97.35]]},{"start":97.91,"end":103.29,"text":"They are also a very important habitat for wading birds, fish and other animals.","words":[["They",97.91,98.23],["are",98.23,98.37],["also",98.37,98.73],["a",98.73,98.93],["very",98.93,99.13],["important",99.13,99.61],["habitat",99.61,100.15],["for",100.15,100.53],["wading",100.53,100.85],["birds,",100.85,101.29],["fish",101.69,102.03],["and",102.03,102.55],["other",102.55,102.81],["animals.",102.81,103.29]]},{"start":103.29,"end":112.47,"text":"In the area where the project is taking place, there have been a number of problems since the area was first settled over 100 years ago.","words":[["In",103.29,104.47],["the",104.47,104.59],["area",104.59,104.93],["where",104.93,105.19],["the",105.19,105.33],["project",105.33,105.73],["is",105.73,105.99],["taking",105.99,106.25],["place,",106.25,106.69],["there",107.11,107.29],["have",107.29,107.47],["been",107.47,107.73],["a",107.73,107.87],["number",107.87,108.11],["of",108.11,108.27],["problems",108.27,108.73],["since",108.73,109.39],["the",109.39,109.65],["area",109.65,109.95],["was",109.95,110.21],["first",110.21,110.55],["settled",110.55,110.95],["over",110.95,111.31],["100",111.31,111.81],["years",111.81,112.13],["ago.",112.13,112.47]]},{"start":113.15,"end":117.51,"text":"Many of the mangrove trees were initially burnt as firewood by local farmers.","words":[["Many",113.15,113.49],["of",113.49,113.73],["the",113.73,113.85],["mangrove",113.85,114.43],["trees",114.43,114.69],["were",114.69,114.99],["initially",114.99,115.45],["burnt",115.45,115.77],["as",115.77,116.01],["firewood",116.01,116.55],["by",116.55,116.79],["local",116.79,117.09],["farmers.",117.09,117.51]]},{"start":118.27,"end":131.61,"text":"The mangrove forests were also poisoned by settlers' farming methods because the farmers used fertilizer to increase crop yields and this started to seep into the water, eventually killing part of the mangrove forest.","words":[["The",118.27,118.39],["mangrove",118.39,118.95],["forests",118.95,119.35],["were",119.35,119.57],["also",119.57,119.89],["poisoned",119.89,120.29],["by",120.29,120.61],["settlers'",120.61,120.99],["farming",121.31,121.51],["methods",121.51,122.03],["because",122.03,122.57],["the",122.57,122.83],["farmers",122.83,123.17],["used",123.17,123.73],["fertilizer",123.73,124.29],["to",124.29,124.91],["increase",124.91,125.49],["crop",125.49,125.77],["yields",125.77,126.17],["and",126.17,126.61],["this",126.61,126.83],["started",126.83,127.15],["to",127.15,127.35],["seep",127.35,127.81],["into",127.81,127.93],["the",127.93,128.11],["water,",128.11,128.43],["eventually",128.95,129.67],["killing",129.67,130.13],["part",130.13,130.49],["of",130.49,130.63],["the",130.63,130.73],["mangrove",130.73,131.27],["forest.",131.27,131.61]]},{"start":132.39,"end":141.35,"text":"Farming in the area wasn't successful, and what was left of the mangrove forest area wasn't valued by local people as crops couldn't be grown there.","words":[["Farming",132.39,133.07],["in",133.07,133.23],["the",133.23,133.35],["area",133.35,133.63],["wasn't",133.63,134.13],["successful,",134.13,134.75],["and",135.05,135.41],["what",135.41,135.63],["was",135.63,135.81],["left",135.81,136.03],["of",136.03,136.21],["the",136.21,136.33],["mangrove",136.33,136.79],["forest",136.79,137.15],["area",137.15,137.59],["wasn't",137.59,138.05],["valued",138.05,138.39],["by",138.39,138.61],["local",138.61,138.91],["people",138.91,139.37],["as",139.37,139.73],["crops",139.73,140.13],["couldn't",140.13,140.61],["be",140.61,140.75],["grown",140.75,141.03],["there.",141.03,141.35]]},{"start":141.93,"end":146.85,"text":"And so what happened was that the area started to be used as somewhere to dump trash.","words":[["And",141.93,142.19],["so",142.19,142.41],["what",142.41,142.61],["happened",142.61,143.05],["was",143.05,143.57],["that",143.57,143.79],["the",143.79,143.89],["area",143.89,144.25],["started",144.25,144.59],["to",144.59,144.79],["be",144.79,144.93],["used",144.93,145.21],["as",145.21,145.47],["somewhere",145.47,145.87],["to",145.87,146.13],["dump",146.13,146.39],["trash.",146.39,146.85]]},{"start":152.08,"end":156.76,"text":"Action was urgently needed to protect the mangrove forest and prevent flooding.","words":[["Action",152.08,152.52],["was",152.52,152.84],["urgently",152.84,153.32],["needed",153.32,153.7],["to",153.7,153.94],["protect",153.94,154.28],["the",154.28,154.5],["mangrove",154.5,155.0],["forest",155.0,155.38],["and",155.38,156.0],["prevent",156.0,156.36],["flooding.",156.36,156.76]]},{"start":157.28,"end":160.44,"text":"And so the mangrove regeneration project was set up.","words":[["And",157.28,157.46],["so",157.46,157.62],["the",157.62,157.76],["mangrove",157.76,158.42],["regeneration",158.42,158.78],["project",158.78,159.68],["was",159.68,159.98],["set",159.98,160.22],["up.",160.22,160.44]]},{"start":160.44,"end":166.56,"text":"The conservationists involved decided to construct a sand barrier around the","words":[["The",160.44,161.46],["conservationists",161.46,162.46],["involved",162.46,162.98],["decided",162.98,163.84],["to",163.84,164.1],["construct",164.1,164.58],["a",164.58,164.8],["sand",164.8,165.2],["barrier",165.2,165.64],["around",165.64,166.26],["the",166.26,166.56]]},{"start":166.56,"end":172.32,"text":"forests, but unfortunately this proved to be ineffective. The only way forward","words":[["forests,",166.56,167.0],["but",167.76,168.04],["unfortunately",168.04,168.68],["this",168.68,169.06],["proved",169.06,169.36],["to",169.36,169.58],["be",169.58,169.76],["ineffective.",169.76,170.32],["The",170.96,171.34],["only",171.34,171.64],["way",171.64,171.86],["forward",171.86,172.32]]},{"start":172.32,"end":178.72,"text":"appeared to be to grow new mangroves from seed. Several species of mangrove","words":[["appeared",172.32,172.94],["to",172.94,173.24],["be",173.24,173.42],["to",173.42,173.6],["grow",173.6,173.98],["new",173.98,174.3],["mangroves",174.3,175.06],["from",175.06,175.4],["seed.",175.4,175.82],["Several",177.0,177.4],["species",177.4,177.8],["of",177.8,178.1],["mangrove",178.1,178.72]]},{"start":178.72,"end":183.02,"text":"inhabit the forests in this area of the United States, but it is the gray","words":[["inhabit",178.72,178.94],["the",178.94,179.24],["forests",179.24,179.64],["in",179.64,179.92],["this",179.92,180.1],["area",180.1,180.46],["of",180.46,180.62],["the",180.62,180.76],["United",180.76,180.94],["States,",180.94,181.54],["but",181.72,182.1],["it",182.1,182.3],["is",182.3,182.46],["the",182.46,182.62],["gray",182.62,183.02]]},{"start":183.02,"end":188.38,"text":"mangroves that we are concerned with here. The seed of this plant is about","words":[["mangroves",183.02,183.82],["that",183.82,184.28],["we",184.28,184.46],["are",184.46,184.6],["concerned",184.6,185.02],["with",185.02,185.32],["here.",185.32,185.6],["The",186.36,186.62],["seed",186.62,186.94],["of",186.94,187.06],["this",187.06,187.22],["plant",187.22,187.58],["is",187.58,188.1],["about",188.1,188.38]]},{"start":188.38,"end":192.92,"text":"the size of an almond and most seeds fall only when they are fully ripe.","words":[["the",188.38,188.62],["size",188.62,188.9],["of",188.9,189.16],["an",189.16,189.3],["almond",189.3,189.56],["and",189.56,190.42],["most",190.42,190.74],["seeds",190.74,191.14],["fall",191.14,191.5],["only",191.5,191.94],["when",191.94,192.1],["they",192.1,192.24],["are",192.24,192.34],["fully",192.34,192.58],["ripe.",192.58,192.92]]},{"start":193.92,"end":200.6,"text":"The mangrove regeneration project first began three years ago. The first set of seedlings was","words":[["The",193.92,194.56],["mangrove",194.56,195.18],["regeneration",195.18,195.56],["project",195.56,196.38],["first",196.38,196.72],["began",196.72,197.2],["three",197.2,197.56],["years",197.56,197.88],["ago.",197.88,198.18],["The",198.86,199.08],["first",199.08,199.46],["set",199.46,199.78],["of",199.78,199.9],["seedlings",199.9,200.4],["was",200.4,200.6]]},{"start":200.6,"end":207.56,"text":"planted in small pots and left to germinate in a hot house. The plants thrived and large roots","words":[["planted",200.6,200.96],["in",200.96,201.2],["small",201.2,201.48],["pots",201.48,201.9],["and",201.9,202.56],["left",202.56,202.86],["to",202.86,203.08],["germinate",203.08,203.5],["in",203.5,203.72],["a",203.72,203.84],["hot",203.84,204.0],["house.",204.0,204.36],["The",205.12,205.22],["plants",205.22,205.62],["thrived",205.62,206.34],["and",206.34,206.82],["large",206.82,207.14],["roots",207.14,207.56]]},{"start":207.56,"end":212.86,"text":"appeared at the bottom of the pots. Ideally, these seedlings should have been conditioned with","words":[["appeared",207.56,207.92],["at",207.92,208.14],["the",208.14,208.24],["bottom",208.24,208.52],["of",208.52,208.72],["the",208.72,208.82],["pots.",208.82,209.22],["Ideally,",210.02,210.66],["these",210.74,210.98],["seedlings",210.98,211.58],["should",211.58,211.84],["have",211.84,211.96],["been",211.96,212.1],["conditioned",212.1,212.56],["with",212.56,212.86]]},{"start":212.86,"end":216.46,"text":"increasingly salty water before being planted in the sea.","words":[["increasingly",212.86,213.46],["salty",213.46,213.84],["water",213.84,214.26],["before",214.26,214.74],["being",214.74,215.46],["planted",215.46,215.88],["in",215.88,216.08],["the",216.08,216.2],["sea.",216.2,216.46]]},{"start":217.16,"end":220.64,"text":"They had, in fact, only been watered with rainwater.","words":[["They",217.16,217.38],["had,",217.38,217.74],["in",217.86,217.96],["fact,",217.96,218.26],["only",218.7,219.06],["been",219.06,219.3],["watered",219.3,219.82],["with",219.82,219.94],["rainwater.",219.94,220.64]]},{"start":221.5,"end":227.46,"text":"As the plants weren't used to a saline environment, it was decided to plant them out on the south","words":[["As",221.5,221.9],["the",221.9,222.1],["plants",222.1,222.46],["weren't",222.46,222.86],["used",222.86,223.12],["to",223.12,223.3],["a",223.3,223.48],["saline",223.48,223.86],["environment,",223.86,224.46],["it",224.86,224.98],["was",224.98,225.12],["decided",225.12,225.64],["to",225.64,225.92],["plant",225.92,226.24],["them",226.24,226.48],["out",226.48,226.78],["on",226.78,227.0],["the",227.0,227.16],["south",227.16,227.46]]},{"start":227.46,"end":229.32,"text":"side of a small island nearby.","words":[["side",227.46,227.88],["of",227.88,228.04],["a",228.04,228.2],["small",228.2,228.42],["island",228.42,228.98],["nearby.",228.98,229.32]]},{"start":230.12,"end":234.76,"text":"It was hoped that this would allow them to get used to salt water gradually, since this","words":[["It",230.12,230.28],["was",230.28,230.38],["hoped",230.38,230.66],["that",230.66,230.96],["this",230.96,231.16],["would",231.16,231.3],["allow",231.3,231.6],["them",231.6,231.8],["to",231.8,231.96],["get",231.96,232.1],["used",232.1,232.34],["to",232.34,232.54],["salt",232.54,232.78],["water",232.78,233.16],["gradually,",233.16,233.76],["since",234.12,234.5],["this",234.5,234.76]]},{"start":234.76,"end":237.46,"text":"part of the island was flooded every day at high tide.","words":[["part",234.76,235.0],["of",235.0,235.1],["the",235.1,235.2],["island",235.2,235.56],["was",235.56,235.82],["flooded",235.82,236.18],["every",236.18,236.48],["day",236.48,236.72],["at",236.72,236.9],["high",236.9,237.12],["tide.",237.12,237.46]]},{"start":237.46,"end":252.62,"text":"There were over 100 plants planted in this particular spot, and it was necessary to protect them not from the large number of wading birds which visit the area looking for food, but from the large rabbit colony living in the area.","words":[["There",237.46,238.42],["were",238.42,238.58],["over",238.58,238.84],["100",238.84,239.36],["plants",239.36,239.9],["planted",239.9,240.34],["in",240.34,240.56],["this",240.56,240.7],["particular",240.7,241.16],["spot,",241.16,241.62],["and",241.92,242.38],["it",242.38,242.48],["was",242.48,242.6],["necessary",242.6,243.1],["to",243.1,243.32],["protect",243.32,243.62],["them",243.62,243.92],["not",243.92,244.48],["from",244.48,244.74],["the",244.74,244.86],["large",244.86,245.16],["number",245.16,245.56],["of",245.56,245.82],["wading",245.82,246.2],["birds",246.2,246.68],["which",246.68,247.1],["visit",247.1,247.48],["the",247.48,247.7],["area",247.7,248.0],["looking",248.0,248.32],["for",248.32,248.62],["food,",248.62,248.98],["but",249.3,249.64],["from",249.64,249.86],["the",249.86,250.02],["large",250.02,250.32],["rabbit",250.32,250.86],["colony",250.86,251.38],["living",251.38,251.9],["in",251.9,252.12],["the",252.12,252.24],["area.",252.24,252.62]]},{"start":253.52,"end":257.66,"text":"The process for the second set of seedlings was completely different.","words":[["The",253.52,